        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although our business does not involve the issuance of stablecoins, the enactment of the GENIUS Act may affect the broader digital asset ecosystem and could indirectly impact the markets in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 42020,
        "end_character": 42227
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001844971-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001844971-26-000011-78302fd0266dbccf",
        "accession_number": "0001844971-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "From time to time, we may sell bitcoin through Coinbase’s brokerage services.",
        "start_character": 22959,
        "end_character": 23036
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001844971-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001844971-26-000011-78302fd0266dbccf",
        "accession_number": "0001844971-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "On March 11, 2026, we commenced an exchange offer (as subsequently modified, supplemented or amended, the “Exchange Offer”), pursuant to which we are offering to exchange up to $36.7 million in aggregate principal amount of our Senior Notes for New Notes.",
        "start_character": 6367,
        "end_character": 6622
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001844971-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001844971-26-000011-78302fd0266dbccf",
        "accession_number": "0001844971-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "This is a critical part of our plan for growth and value creation as we develop our business.",
        "start_character": 32435,
        "end_character": 32528
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001844971-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001844971-26-000011-78302fd0266dbccf",
        "accession_number": "0001844971-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the NYDIG Hosting Agreement, we agreed to host, power, and provide technical support services, and other related services, to NYDIG affiliates’ mining equipment at the New York Facility for a term of five years.",
        "start_character": 9592,
        "end_character": 9809
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001844971-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001844971-26-000011-78302fd0266dbccf",
        "accession_number": "0001844971-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate our electricity generating business subject to the following regulatory regimes:",
        "start_character": 44794,
        "end_character": 44885
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001844971-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001844971-26-000011-78302fd0266dbccf",
        "accession_number": "0001844971-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We utilize Coinbase’s custodial and brokerage services to hold, transfer and, from time to time, sell our bitcoin.",
        "start_character": 20955,
        "end_character": 21069
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001844971-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001844971-26-000011-78302fd0266dbccf",
        "accession_number": "0001844971-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, when market conditions dictate shutting down mining, to the extent not already curtailed for profitability pursuant to the NYDIG Hosting Agreement, and making market sales of energy, we are required to pay NYDIG the expected value that it would have received as if the cryptocurrency datacenter had operated and a portion of gross margin from energy sales above normal mining requirements.",
        "start_character": 10627,
        "end_character": 11030
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001844971-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001844971-26-000011-78302fd0266dbccf",
        "accession_number": "0001844971-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Because our power generation facility operates continuously we are able to optimize between hosting, power, and cryptocurrency datacenter revenue depending on prevailing market conditions, which may enhance revenue opportunities and operational flexibility.",
        "start_character": 30019,
        "end_character": 30276
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001844971-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001844971-26-000011-78302fd0266dbccf",
        "accession_number": "0001844971-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, as we evaluate opportunities related to AI and HPC development, we may compete with traditional datacenter developers and operators, hyperscale cloud providers, cryptocurrency mining companies that are repurposing or expanding their infrastructure to support AI and HPC workloads, and other infrastructure companies seeking access to large amounts of reliable and competitively priced power capacity.",
        "start_character": 24452,
        "end_character": 24865
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001844971-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001844971-26-000011-78302fd0266dbccf",
        "accession_number": "0001844971-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, as we expand into the development and operation of AI and HPC workloads, we may become subject to various laws, ordinances and regulations in the United States and internationally.",
        "start_character": 43251,
        "end_character": 43444
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001844971-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001844971-26-000011-78302fd0266dbccf",
        "accession_number": "0001844971-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we have developed and may further develop certain proprietary software applications for purposes of our bitcoin mining-related operations.",
        "start_character": 32083,
        "end_character": 32234
      }
    ]
